    "review": "All required facts, exact prices, the 48-hour notice, tel and mailto links, and relevant supplied illustrations are present with no invented claims. The layout is a bare stacked default: it does not adapt to desktop, spacing is missing, nav and footer links run together, and the result is far from professional.",
    "brief": {
        "summary": "Build the page for Crumb & Co., a neighbourhood bakery at 14 Alder Street.\nHours: Tuesday to Friday 7:00-15:00, Saturday and Sunday 8:00-14:00, closed Monday.\nKnown for: sourdough (baked daily, $8 a loaf), cardamom buns ($4.50), and a\nseasonal fruit galette (from $26, order 48 hours ahead).\nPre-orders: by phone, (555) 010-4477, or email orders@example.com.\nThey want it to feel warm and hand-made, not corporate. Supplied synthetic illustrations show sourdough and cardamom buns, not photographs of the actual bakery.\n\nImage version: images-v1. Up to four supplied images are available through cms_assets(). Use only its approved handles. Every image is a synthetic illustration, not evidence of actual people, premises, results or product interfaces. Do not turn incidental objects, finishes or accessories into product claims. Choose relevant images and supply descriptive alt text; no external image URLs.",
